<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f3f6fb;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eef2f7 0%, #f8fbff 100%);
        }

        .app-shell {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .sidebar {
            background: #002f66;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 32px 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .brand {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .sidebar p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.85;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .nav-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: grid;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .nav-item {
            display: block;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            color: #dbeafe;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .nav-item:hover,
        .nav-item.active {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .nav-item span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .main-content {
            padding: 28px 32px;
        }

        .header-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
            align-items: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .page-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .subtitle {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 15px;
            max-width: 640px;
        }

        .panel {
            display: grid;
            gap: 22px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
        }

        .cards-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .book-card {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 18px;
            min-height: 320px;
        }

        .book-card img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 18px;
            aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
            object-fit: cover;
            background: #e2e8f0;
        }

        .book-info {
            flex: 1;
        }

        .book-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .book-author {
            margin: 6px 0 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .stats-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        .stat-pill {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 12px;
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .stat-pill strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 18px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            background: #1d4ed8;
        }

        .button-secondary {
            background: #f1f5f9;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .button-secondary:hover {
            background: #e2e8f0;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border-spacing: 0;
        }

        th, td {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 14px 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        th {
            color: #334155;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        td {
            color: #475569;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.01em;
        }

        .status-success {
            background: #e0f2fe;
            color: #0369a1;
        }

        .status-warning {
            background: #fef3c7;
            color: #a16207;
        }

        .status-danger {
            background: #fee2e2;
            color: #b91c1c;
        }

        .status-default {
            background: #f8fafc;
            color: #334155;
        }

        .form-grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        label {
            display: grid;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #475569;
        }

        input, select, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 140px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .alert {
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            gap: 24px;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px;
        }

        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            gap: 20px;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        }

        .metric-card {
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
        }

        .metric-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .metric-card p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .small-text {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .help-text {
            margin-top: 14px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #475569;
        }

        .shadow-panel {
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);
        }

        .inline-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-width: 88px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .badge.green { background: #daf5e0; color:#166534; }
        .badge.blue { background: #dbeafe; color:#1d4ed8; }
        .badge.red { background: #fee2e2; color:#b91c1c; }
        .badge.gray { background: #e2e8f0; color:#475569; }

        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .grid-2-left {
            display: grid;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        @media(max-width: 1024px) {
            .app-shell { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .sidebar { flex-direction: row; overflow-x: auto; min-height: auto; padding: 20px; }
            .nav-list { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
            .main-content { padding: 20px; }
            .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="brand">Conecta Biblioteca</div>
        <p>Interface de demonstração para o sistema de biblioteca autônoma com RFID/NFC.</p>
        <ul class="nav-list">
            <li><a href="/app/biblioteca" class="nav-item <%= active === 'biblioteca' ? 'active' : '' %>">Biblioteca</a></li>
            <li><a href="/app/reservas/1" class="nav-item <%= active === 'reservas' ? 'active' : '' %>"><span>Minhas Reservas</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/app/emprestimos/1" class="nav-item <%= active === 'emprestimos' ? 'active' : '' %>"><span>Empréstimos do Aluno</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/app/vigilante" class="nav-item <%= active === 'vigilante' ? 'active' : '' %>"><span>Painel do Vigilante</span></a></li>
            <li><a href="/app/monitor" class="nav-item <%= active === 'monitor' ? 'active' : '' %>"><span>Monitor RFID/NFC</span></a></li>
        </ul>
    </aside>
    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="header-row">
            <div>
                <h1 class="page-title"><%= title %></h1>
                <p class="subtitle">Use essa interface para representar o fluxo de biblioteca autônoma sem totem com tela.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
